  "description": "The ladies’ Caferacer Solo is built around a beautiful “mixte” style step-through lightweight welded Cromoly steel frame with a characteristic double top tube. It has all the features you need to ride every day with speed and comfort. Equipped with a comfy Creme saddle and gummy grips. The unique Chrome-plated front rack is very practical - you can keep your eyes on your precious bag at all times. This version has a 7-speed Shimano internal gear hub that offers a wide range and clean and service-free use for years. A retro style Creme crank with forged alloy chainring, and a custom Creme high polished headset. Browse the models and enjoy the beautiful Pearl White and Tuscany Sky colourways that reflect in the stainless steel fenders.",
